Stack: HTML/CSS/ES-module JS, Three.js r160, Cesium, Vercel static + serverless. No npm, no build.
Two coordinate systems: Global (Three.js, East=+X, Up=+Y, North=−Z) and Design (user-set via designNorthAngle).
Two viewports: Cesium globe (startup) → Three.js 2D/3D (after OSM/CAD import).
API layer: api/*.js — Vercel serverless, CJS only (module.exports =, never export default).
Supabase: gpr_projects table, sfvwhbzxkzlscfsnyrwq project. Key = sb_publishable_ format.
LAI database (LAI_categorised.csv) is core IP — never expose to external APIs.
App Vercel root: app/ only. api/ = serverless. lai/, _dev/, _context/ never deployed.

